{"createdAt":"2026-10-01T03:25:31.425Z","data":{"body":[{"_key":"p1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Hack Clubとは"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"p3","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p2","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Hack Clubは、世界中の高校生を対象としたプログラミングおよびメイカースクール（ものづくり）の非営利団体が運営するネットワークです。Hack Clubは現在世界中に多くの参加者(2024年11月時点)がおり、その数は８万人を超えており、毎週数千人の学生が多様なプロジェクトに取り組んでいます。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"blockquote"},{"_key":"p6","_type":"link_card","description":"Hack Club is the world's largest nonprofit movement of teenagers making cool projects.","fetchedAt":"2026-10-03T14:16:02.941Z","id":"https://hackclub.com","image":"../../media/dce5862e807e0deb7c851b961a41cd3d661ffd3c9fa6484d268d6763e1795e48.png","metadataUrl":"https://hackclub.com","siteName":"Hack Club","title":"Hack Club — Where teens make cool stuff.","unavailable":false},{"_key":"p8","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p7","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Slack上で活動している"}],"level":1,"listItem":"bullet","markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pa","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p9","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"18歳以下対象"}],"level":1,"listItem":"bullet","markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pc","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pb","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"時々イベントやっていて、いろいろもらえたりする"}],"level":1,"listItem":"bullet","markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"date_precision":"day","description":"Hack Clubという英語圏のコミュニティがあるのでおすすめする","emoji":"💻","hidden_from_listing":false,"is_work_in_progress":true,"properties":{},"published_updated_at":"2025-12-15T00:00:00.000Z","title":"Hack Clubのすすめ","translation":null},"id":"01M3TQXVD1DWK6R4V4T0F1Y651","locale":"ja","publishedAt":"2025-12-15T00:00:00.000Z","seo":{"canonical":null,"description":null,"image":null,"noIndex":false,"title":null},"slug":"hack-club","terms":{"category":[{"id":"01M40J9FP17FKF8Y1P7W5ASMV2","label":"技術","locale":"ja","name":"category","parentId":null,"slug":"tech","translationGroup":"01M40J9FD